Examples:

Input: n = 3, s = "GACCBDDBAGEE"
Output: 1
Explanation: Only D will not be able to get any computer. So the answer is 1.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

class Solution {
    public int solve(int n, String s) {
        int[] state = new int[26];
        
        int com = n;
        int ans = 0;
        
        for(char ch:s.toCharArray()){
            int idx = ch - 'A';
            
            // first occurence
            if(state[idx] == 0){
                if(com > 0){
                    com--;
                    state[idx] = 1;
                }else{
                    ans++;
                    state[idx] = 2;
                }
            }
            // second occurence
            else if(state[idx] == 1){
                com++;
                state[idx] = 0;
            }
            // second occurence of a rejected customer
            else{
                state[idx] = 0;
            }
        }
        return ans;
    }
}
